{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10117180","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10117180","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1011718001:0":{"text":"세시아, 왜 손을 거둔 거지?!\n당신에게 힘을 나눠줬으니 지지 않을 거라고!","source_cn":"瑟西娅，为什么收手？！\\n力量已经分给你，你不可能输！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x184D34D133A64B25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1011718002:0":{"text":"어리석긴...","source_cn":"愚蠢啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCBF6C055A0CF95D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1011718003:0":{"text":"뭐라고?!","source_cn":"你说什么？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4954C81085A1291","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1011718004:0":{"text":"황혼의 나무의 생명력을 뽑아낼 수 없어서 계획은 실패했어.","source_cn":"流荧树的生命力无法抽取，计划已然败露。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x896D93269E0CC9AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1011718005:0":{"text":"비록 뜻대로 되진 않았지만 갈망하던 힘을 일부 손에 넣었지.","source_cn":"虽然没有完全如愿，渴求的部分力量也已经到手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7F7F1E7E50473A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1011718006:0":{"text":"말해 봐, 내가 한낱 살아있는 자를 돕기 위해 굴복할 이유가 있을까?","source_cn":"告诉我，还有什么理由能让我纡尊降贵，来帮助区区一个生者？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE601A356F87156F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1011718007:0":{"text":"너... 맹세를 어길 셈이야?!","source_cn":"你——你要违背誓约？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x242B0450FEB3EB3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1011718008:0":{"text":"흥, 가식으로 가득 찬 네가 불멸의 망자에게 명령할 자격이 있나?!","source_cn":"哼，虚伪矫饰如你，也配命令不朽的亡者？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE20BDFB835019370","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1011718009:0":{"text":"이 재미 없는 연극은 이제 그만하겠어...!","source_cn":"这场无趣的闹剧，不必再演下去了……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20D0D3068CA0556A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:伊米尔":{"text":"이미르","source":"伊米尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:瑟西娅":{"text":"세시아","source":"瑟西娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":10,"localized_text_count":9,"speaker_count":2}}